13. For the foregoing reasons, this Court proceeds to pass the following:
ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The judgment and award passed by the Tribunal passed in MVC.No.1405/2022 is modified;
NC: 2024:KHC-K:9610 (iii) The appellant/Insurance compensation shall satisfy the award and then recover from the owner of the offending vehicle;
(iv) The amount in deposit, if any, shall be forthwith remitted to the Tribunal;
(v) The records, if any, shall be remitted to the Tribunal forthwith.

